      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One-click onboarding — the console generates all of this per member and environment",
      "originalText": "One-click onboarding — the console generates all of this per member and environment",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_92",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 52,
      "y": 472,
      "width": 1436,
      "height": 57,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1716710914,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 253559258,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pick a client and an environment → the console issues a scoped platform key, prints the exact config, and offers an MDM bundle.\nIt also runs a preflight: key valid · alias reachable · residency attested · MCP grants present · a live test call and tool list.\nIf the preflight fails it names the missing step and links to it. 'It shows zero tools' must never be something a user has to debug.",
      "originalText": "Pick a client and an environment → the console issues a scoped platform key, prints the exact config, and offers an MDM bundle.\nIt also runs a preflight: key valid · alias reachable · residency attested · MCP grants present · a live test call and tool list.\nIf the preflight fails it names the missing step and links to it. 'It shows zero tools' must never be something a user has to debug.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
