      "locked": false,
      "text": "How the router decides",
      "originalText": "How the router decides",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text_9r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 812,
      "y": 862,
      "width": 676,
      "height": 132,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 434654401,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 287359481,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Filter  endpoints failing a hard constraint are removed — never overridden by weights.\n2. Score   quality/cost/latency from a rolling window per endpoint, not a static table.\n3. Pick    weighted choice with deterministic tie-break on (session, alias) so a\n           conversation stays on one endpoint unless it degrades.\n4. Track   actual split is reported against the target; drift shows as a metric.\n5. Degrade budget exhaustion and breaker trips walk down a declared ladder, and the\n           reason is attached to the response headers and the event.",
      "originalText": "1. Filter  endpoints failing a hard constraint are removed — never overridden by weights.\n2. Score   quality/cost/latency from a rolling window per endpoint, not a static table.\n3. Pick    weighted choice with deterministic tie-break on (session, alias) so a\n           conversation stays on one endpoint unless it degrades.\n4. Track   actual split is reported against the target; drift shows as a metric.\n5. Degrade budget exhaustion and breaker trips walk down a declared ladder, and the\n           reason is attached to the response headers and the event.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.45,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
